&lt;td style="width: 8.25pt; border: none; padding: 0in 2.65pt 0in 2.65pt; height: 12.75pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="11"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 63.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: double black 2.25pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0in .75pt 0in 0in; height: 12.75pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="85"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; tab-stops: 42.45pt 60.35pt; margin: 1.65pt 0in 1.5pt 0in;" align="right"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;"&gt;$&lt;font style="mso-tab-count: 1;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;100&lt;font style="mso-tab-count: 1;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;

&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;The difference between the actual tax expense and the &amp;#8220;expected&amp;#8221; tax expense (computed by applying the applicable U.S.&amp;#160;federal corporate tax rate of 21.00% to earnings before income taxes) is attributable to the change in the valuation allowance against deferred tax assets.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;Income taxes payable under the tax&amp;#8209;sharing agreement were $&lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;100&lt;/font&gt; and $&lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;0&lt;/font&gt; as of &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;September&amp;#160;30, 2025&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;, respectively, and are included in Taxes Accrued in the balance sheets.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;In fiscal years ended &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2025&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;, the Company made income tax payments of $0 and $850 respectively. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; page-break-after: avoid; margin: 12.0pt 0in 6.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;The tax effects of temporary differences that give rise to significant portions of the deferred tax assets and deferred tax liabilities at September&amp;#160;30, &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2025&lt;/font&gt; and&lt;font style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt; are presented below, respectively:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div align="right"&gt;
&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" style="border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;" border="1" width="613" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

