&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 63.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: double black 2.25pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0in .75pt 0in 0in; height: 12.75pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="85"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; tab-stops: 48.45pt 60.35pt; margin: 1.65pt 0in 1.5pt 0in;" align="right"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;"&gt;$&lt;font style="mso-tab-count: 1;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&amp;#8212; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 8.25pt; border: none; padding: 0in 2.65pt 0in 2.65pt; height: 12.75pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="11"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 63.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: double black 2.25pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0in .75pt 0in 0in; height: 12.75pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="85"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; tab-stops: 48.45pt 60.35pt; margin: 1.65pt 0in 1.5pt 0in;" align="right"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;"&gt;$&lt;font style="mso-tab-count: 1;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&amp;#8212; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;

&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;September&amp;#160;30, 2025&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;, the Company had recorded valuation allowances of &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;$1,473,905&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;$1,483,106&lt;/font&gt;, respectively. In assessing the realizability of deferred tax assets, management considers whether it is more likely than not that some portion or all of the deferred tax assets will not be realized. The ultimate realization of deferred tax assets is dependent upon the expected availability of future taxable income during the periods in which those temporary differences become deductible and prior to the expiration of the deferred tax assets as governed by the Internal Revenue Code. Management considers projected future taxable income and tax planning strategies in making this assessment. Given the FERC Tariff as discussed in &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;note&amp;#160;1&lt;/font&gt;, the Company would not expect to have a material amount of taxable income in the future. The valuation allowance primarily relates to net operating losses that, in the Company&amp;#8217;s judgment, are not more likely than not to be realized based on the Company&amp;#8217;s projections for future taxable income.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;At &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;September&amp;#160;30, 2025&lt;/font&gt;, open tax years for federal and state returns are &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2022&lt;/font&gt; and forward. There were no federal or state tax audits during &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2025&lt;/font&gt; or &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="WordSection4"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; mso-outline-level: 1; tab-stops: 0in; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;(&lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;4&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;font style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;Commitment and Contingencies &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;On July 8, 2021, an asbestos claim was filed against VYNPC in the Vermont Superior Court. After discovery, GMP filed a successful motion to dismiss the case on the basis of the statute of repose. Plaintiff appealed the trial court&amp;#8217;s dismissal order to the Vermont Supreme Court. Costs associated with this claim and the appeal have been collected from Sponsors pursuant to the terms of the FERC Tariff. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;On June 4, 2024, the Vermont Supreme Court issued its mandate dismissing the case on the basis of the statute of repose, after affirming the trial court's decision. No further billing for fees or potential damages will be incurred.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="WordSection5"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -21.25pt; line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; mso-outline-level: 1; tab-stops: .5in; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;(&lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;5&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;font style="mso-tab-count: 1;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;Related Party Transactions &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; tab-stops: .5in; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;Effective October&amp;#160;1, 2012, the Company entered into a Services Agreement with GMP, parent to the Company. The Company recorded $100,631 of GMP service fees operating expense on the statements of income of the years ended &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;September&amp;#160;30, 2025&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 1; tab-stops: .5in; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;(&lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;6&lt;/font&gt;) &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;&lt;font style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;Subsequent Events &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; tab-stops: .5in; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 22.5pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company considers events or transactions that occur after the balance sheet date, but before the financial statements are issued, to provide additional evidence relative to certain estimates or to identify matters that require additional disclosure. These financial statements were available to be issued on &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;November 21,&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="color: black;"&gt;2025&lt;/font&gt; and subsequent events have been evaluated through that date.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
